# New Way Forward (CR 615.8, 603.12): "the next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn". Bot1 chooses Bot2's
# Fencing Ace (double strike, 1/1) as it attacks. Its first-strike damage is the next time: prevented, and the reflexive ability
# deals that 1 damage to the Ace's controller, Bot2, and Bot1 draws 1 card. The effect is then used up, so the regular damage 1 is
# dealt to Bot1: Bot1 19, Bot2 19. Bot1's hand is 2 cards once New Way Forward is cast and 3 after the ability resolves.

